@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+First question: when a feature is added to a slice or taken out of it after a plan exists, what must the plan play do with the stories? If a feature is out, the stories have to be removed from the plan. That's simple, right? You don't make duplicate stories for a feature, and if a feature is out, the plan doesn't delete the story. The story can exist because it's been created, but it moves out of the plan. Email question is right.  so yes
